# The checkpoint under `model/` is stored with Git LFS.
#
# The weight shards are hundreds of megabytes of opaque binary; keeping them in
# the object store would put a whole copy of every shard in history for every
# revision of it, and `tokenizer.json` is thirty megabytes of one long line that
# no diff can usefully describe. Everything else in the repository is text and
# is left exactly as git already handles it — no `text` or `eol` rules here, so
# adding this file renormalizes nothing.
model/*.safetensors filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
model/tokenizer.json filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
